ind Randle and Porter, so about 21% usage with slightly fewer shots than the base.","sources":["https://youtu.be/lOshTzDA4SA?t=1181"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}